00:36:27.460 --> 00:36:31.740
Yeah, fair. Okay, so it gets crazier than what I was describing.

00:36:33.240 --> 00:36:41.280
Great. Right? Because what happens in the game, all right, is, let's say you beat the Juggernaut, okay?

