00:39:18.560 --> 00:39:25.680
But, yeah, context still bothers me, and the fact that you probably just, you know, I mean, for most of the rest of history,

00:39:25.680 --> 00:39:28.200
most people probably won't have the original label.

00:39:28.920 --> 00:39:35.180
So, I mean, I don't know how much of a longevity they thought this game was going to have, but that bothers me.

