How often do you jump in real life?

00:42:42.540 --> 00:42:44.140
I'm not very. It doesn't mean you can't.

00:42:44.420 --> 00:42:53.940
It's true. But, you know, in a platforming game or a side-scrolling action game like TMNT, you jump an awful lot because that's the way that the stages are designed.

00:42:54.300 --> 00:42:56.340
