00:42:56.600 --> 00:43:06.940
So, you know, like, the only thing they would be useful for is for dodging enemies or jumping over enemies in that regard, I guess.

00:43:07.080 --> 00:43:09.200
But, again, I don't know why you would have to do that.

00:43:09.200 --> 00:43:14.420
Right. I thought at one point that, like, no matter who you were when you jump, you got, like, a boost of speed.

00:43:14.420 --> 00:43:20.800
