00:43:58.080 --> 00:43:59.080
And that's crazy.

00:43:59.080 --> 00:44:06.580
Which, like, fine, not the end of the world, but this is, like, it seems like this is better played as a two-player game, which I didn't do.

00:44:06.680 --> 00:44:10.640
But if you play this as two-player, you're just constantly both pausing it in the middle of the action.

00:44:10.960 --> 00:44:13.000
Like, without, you know, you're like, I'm going to pause it now.

00:44:13.100 --> 00:44:14.520
Like, hold on. I'm going to unpause it now.

00:44:14.700 --> 00:44:16.300
Like, it's just weird.

00:44:16.380 --> 00:44:17.460
And you can't tell.

00:44:17.600 --> 00:44:20.320
You can't tell if you're about to die unless you pause it.

00:44:20.380 --> 00:44:22.080
You're just constantly pausing and unpausing.

